{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31097","headline":"题盐铁李尚书滻州别业 · 薛能","name":"题盐铁李尚书滻州别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹿原阴面滻州湄，坐觉林泉逼梦思。\n闲景院开花落後，湿香风好雨来时。\n邻惊麦野闻雏雉，别创茅亭住老师。\n备足好中还有阙，许昌军里李陵诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}